  "esp.calamar.cocina": {"en": "Fried in its ink with white rice, or grilled whole with garlic.", "gl": "Frito na súa tinta con arroz branco, ou á prancha enteira con allo."},
  "esp.calamar.curiosidad": {"en": "The lights of the jigging boats illuminate the ría at night in autumn: the squid rises to the light and is caught with a spoon, one by one.", "gl": "As luces dos barcos de poteras iluminan a ría pola noite no outono: a lura sobe á luz e péscase con culleriña, unha a unha."},
