  "art.9.excerpt": {"en": "The work of Aguiño’s shellfish gatherers follows the tide clock: low tide by day, the fish market at dawn, and a law that reserves the estuary for those with a permit.", "gl": "O traballo das mariscadoras de Aguiño segue o reloxo das mareas: baixamar de día, lonxa á alborada e unha lei que reserva a ría para quen ten permiso."},
